Inspired by the Motion Sound R3-147 rotary speaker simulator; not affiliated with or endorsed by Motion Sound. No
code is copied from another plugin. The approach (a one-pole band split, horn delay modulation per microphone, horn
and bass amplitude modulation) follows the Leslie program of Hundekraft's Rackverb (synth_sdk/plugins/rackverb), which
is under the same GPL-3.0-or-later terms with the additional permission above.

The complete corresponding source of rotor147.knl is this folder (rotor147.c, rc_dsp.h, plugin.json), built and packed
with tools/pack-plugin.sh against the Hundekraft 3.3.2 source; see the project README.
